{
  "id": "24f24eb1ed548087ad55cb058db6fbe8",
  "title": "BoE: Back of the Envelope Estimation",
  "sourceUrl": "https://xpandeyed.notion.site/BoE-Back-of-the-Envelope-Estimation-24f24eb1ed548087ad55cb058db6fbe8?pvs=23",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed54801a82b3f6d35b3a1865",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "A quick, approximate calculation to estimate <span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"1\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">scale, resources, cost, or feasibility</span> of a system.",
      "text": "A quick, approximate calculation to estimate scale, resources, cost, or feasibility of a system."
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed54801697c8d46396fc3241",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Uses <span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"1\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">simple assumptions, rounding, and order-of-magnitude reasoning</span>, not exact values.",
      "text": "Uses simple assumptions, rounding, and order-of-magnitude reasoning, not exact values."
    },
    {
      "id": "29724eb1ed548043824cff7ba76609f4",
      "type": "callout",
      "parent": "27524eb1ed54801697c8d46396fc3241"
    },
    {
      "id": "29724eb1ed5480258663c8ba33b54347",
      "type": "text",
      "parent": "29724eb1ed548043824cff7ba76609f4",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Order of magnitude reasoning</span> means estimating quantities roughly — by powers of ten — to understand scale, not exact numbers.",
      "text": "Order of magnitude reasoning means estimating quantities roughly — by powers of ten — to understand scale, not exact numbers."
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed548000bdf2f685ec04f3d5",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Produces <span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"1\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">ballpark answers</span> fast to guide design choices and highlight dominant factors.",
      "text": "Produces ballpark answers fast to guide design choices and highlight dominant factors."
    },
    {
      "id": "29724eb1ed54803abf89e3500b9e7591",
      "type": "callout",
      "parent": "27524eb1ed548000bdf2f685ec04f3d5"
    },
    {
      "id": "29724eb1ed548036b6dad4cdb7b209a5",
      "type": "text",
      "parent": "29724eb1ed54803abf89e3500b9e7591",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Ballpark answers</span> mean <span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"2\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">rough, approximate estimates</span> — not exact figures, but close enough to understand the <span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"4\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">scale or feasibility</span> of something.",
      "text": "Ballpark answers mean rough, approximate estimates — not exact figures, but close enough to understand the scale or feasibility of something."
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed548007b4c6f752c409f7f5",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "This includes estimating:",
      "text": "This includes estimating:"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed548096aee2f82eb050b92a",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Number of users (daily active users [DAU], monthly active users [MAU])",
      "text": "Number of users (daily active users [DAU], monthly active users [MAU])"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480b3a032fd4c5be24eb1",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Data storage requirements",
      "text": "Data storage requirements"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480859a6fdeca74df1e9c",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Network traffic (read and write bandwidth)",
      "text": "Network traffic (read and write bandwidth)"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed54809499c1f59bd404c9f0",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Compute demand (queries per second, requests per second)",
      "text": "Compute demand (queries per second, requests per second)"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed548011a65aec114da3bf22",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Performance expectations (latency and throughput)",
      "text": "Performance expectations (latency and throughput)"
    },
    {
      "id": "29724eb1ed5480059f98c55b1c0e59f6",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "For the purpose of:",
      "text": "For the purpose of:"
    },
    {
      "id": "29724eb1ed548084b155d490be1cd84a",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "To check <span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"1\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">feasibility</span> of a design before detailed modelling.",
      "text": "To check feasibility of a design before detailed modelling."
    },
    {
      "id": "29724eb1ed548059856dea13e0d69db9",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "To detect <span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"1\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">bottlenecks</span> early (compute, storage, bandwidth).",
      "text": "To detect bottlenecks early (compute, storage, bandwidth)."
    },
    {
      "id": "29724eb1ed5480ec8f85f7c1736743fe",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "To compare <span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"1\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">trade-offs</span> between design choices.",
      "text": "To compare trade-offs between design choices."
    },
    {
      "id": "29724eb1ed5480729a30c0f775b16b5b",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "To plan <span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"1\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">capacity and cost</span> in early design phases.",
      "text": "To plan capacity and cost in early design phases."
    },
    {
      "id": "29724eb1ed5480edac8fdd58979c3769",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "And of course, to show <span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"1\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">scale-awareness</span> in interviews.",
      "text": "And of course, to show scale-awareness in interviews."
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480ebae1cceb8b83729b5",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Without this:",
      "text": "Without this:"
    },
    {
      "id": "29724eb1ed5480dfb7c1db31eee686f6",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Under-provisioning</span> → system outages, poor user experience, loss of users/revenue.",
      "text": "Under-provisioning → system outages, poor user experience, loss of users/revenue."
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed548057a630d7d6b4644314",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Over-provisioning</span> → wasted cost, extra complexity, delayed delivery.",
      "text": "Over-provisioning → wasted cost, extra complexity, delayed delivery."
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480928b84ce427e1229e0",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">BoE estimation</span> ensures you size resources early and avoid costly mistakes.",
      "text": "BoE estimation ensures you size resources early and avoid costly mistakes."
    },
    {
      "id": "29724eb1ed5480c08e70ec0c377bf30f",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Typical outputs include:",
      "text": "Typical outputs include:"
    },
    {
      "id": "29724eb1ed5480de8b70dd092adef0b6",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "29724eb1ed5480c08e70ec0c377bf30f",
      "html": "Servers needed",
      "text": "Servers needed"
    },
    {
      "id": "29724eb1ed5480269d5bdb0d09bc069f",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "29724eb1ed5480c08e70ec0c377bf30f",
      "html": "Storage required",
      "text": "Storage required"
    },
    {
      "id": "29724eb1ed54809db68bf7fc5a776235",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "29724eb1ed5480c08e70ec0c377bf30f",
      "html": "Bandwidth required",
      "text": "Bandwidth required"
    },
    {
      "id": "29724eb1ed548029899df093024c2f8f",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "29724eb1ed5480c08e70ec0c377bf30f",
      "html": "Requests per second (RPS)",
      "text": "Requests per second (RPS)"
    },
    {
      "id": "29724eb1ed54808cbbdfcbf9a82eec9b",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "29724eb1ed5480c08e70ec0c377bf30f",
      "html": "Cost (rough order)",
      "text": "Cost (rough order)"
    },
    {
      "id": "29724eb1ed548028bbbdfe9c065888dc",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "29724eb1ed5480c08e70ec0c377bf30f",
      "html": "Feasibility (yes/no)",
      "text": "Feasibility (yes/no)"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480d1a947d2845c415571",
      "type": "callout"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480b39f68d7e5d58be090",
      "type": "text",
      "parent": "27524eb1ed5480d1a947d2845c415571",
      "html": "Demographic division (e.g., “30% users in India, 20% in US”) is usually a <span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"1\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">business or product analysis</span> concern, not part of back-of-the-envelope <span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"3\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">system design estimation</span> — unless geography directly affects the system load (like needing regional CDNs, data localization laws, or peak-hour traffic patterns).",
      "text": "Demographic division (e.g., “30% users in India, 20% in US”) is usually a business or product analysis concern, not part of back-of-the-envelope system design estimation — unless geography directly affects the system load (like needing regional CDNs, data localization laws, or peak-hour traffic patterns)."
    },
