      "type": "sub_header",
      "html": "1. Clarify Scope",
      "text": "1. Clarify Scope"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480209535c8b2fc3fb572",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Before estimating anything, you must <span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"1\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">define the boundaries of the problem</span>. Without this, numbers are meaningless.",
      "text": "Before estimating anything, you must define the boundaries of the problem. Without this, numbers are meaningless."
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480f299efe2903443b7ef",
      "type": "sub_sub_header",
      "html": "What to clarify",
      "text": "What to clarify"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed548054a363c5c495f5ec93",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Features in scope</span>",
      "text": "Features in scope"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed54804aaeabc6a7d3a233f7",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "27524eb1ed548054a363c5c495f5ec93",
      "html": "What functionality are we supporting? (e.g., photo sharing, messaging, video streaming)",
      "text": "What functionality are we supporting? (e.g., photo sharing, messaging, video streaming)"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480749b00ed4af37ba574",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "27524eb1ed548054a363c5c495f5ec93",
      "html": "Each feature has different storage, bandwidth, and compute patterns.",
      "text": "Each feature has different storage, bandwidth, and compute patterns."
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480249069c5488ea1e4cd",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">User base</span>",
      "text": "User base"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed54808c93bdcb17d7dc0f21",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "27524eb1ed5480249069c5488ea1e4cd",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Total users</span> (registered).",
      "text": "Total users (registered)."
