      "id": "27524eb1ed548020912fc448fbe7ea15",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "27524eb1ed5480249069c5488ea1e4cd",
      "html": "Clarify <span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"1\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">geography</span> (local vs global users → affects latency/bandwidth).",
      "text": "Clarify geography (local vs global users → affects latency/bandwidth)."
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480119f3dc9ad9c07c0f8",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Usage patterns</span>",
      "text": "Usage patterns"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480c1ba12d823e9016d50",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "27524eb1ed5480119f3dc9ad9c07c0f8",
      "html": "How often does a user interact? (e.g., avg posts/day, reads/day).",
      "text": "How often does a user interact? (e.g., avg posts/day, reads/day)."
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480b798bcf8b9fb0c280d",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "27524eb1ed5480119f3dc9ad9c07c0f8",
      "html": "Average session length, request rate, upload/download size.",
      "text": "Average session length, request rate, upload/download size."
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480eb8280c4a56e9f8db4",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "27524eb1ed5480119f3dc9ad9c07c0f8",
      "html": "Ratio of reads to writes (often 10:1 or higher).",
      "text": "Ratio of reads to writes (often 10:1 or higher)."
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed548086b452e15b68d9ba4a",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Growth expectations</span>",
      "text": "Growth expectations"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed54807ba81efa8a90f7a7c7",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "27524eb1ed548086b452e15b68d9ba4a",
      "html": "Year 1, Year 3 horizon.",
      "text": "Year 1, Year 3 horizon."
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480ad9a35ec298bb5d0b9",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "27524eb1ed548086b452e15b68d9ba4a",
      "html": "Peak events (launch, viral growth, Black Friday spikes).",
      "text": "Peak events (launch, viral growth, Black Friday spikes)."
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed548004b937f6faeaaea628",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Non-functional requirements</span>",
      "text": "Non-functional requirements"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480c491c9e24ac330b3ae",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "27524eb1ed548004b937f6faeaaea628",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Latency targets</span> (e.g., &lt;200 ms for API response).",
      "text": "Latency targets (e.g., <200 ms for API response)."
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed54808983a1e10729619c8e",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "27524eb1ed548004b937f6faeaaea628",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Availability targets</span> (99.9% vs 99.99%).",
      "text": "Availability targets (99.9% vs 99.99%)."
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed54809f9afae1ed4cc22f2f",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "27524eb1ed548004b937f6faeaaea628",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Consistency model</span> (eventual vs strong).",
      "text": "Consistency model (eventual vs strong)."
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480e892c3ef8a4a2b789d",
      "type": "sub_sub_header",
      "html": "Why this matters",
      "text": "Why this matters"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480168b02f328399e9d58",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Defines <span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"1\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">what to calculate</span> and prevents wasted time on irrelevant components.",
      "text": "Defines what to calculate and prevents wasted time on irrelevant components."
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed54807f8c8fec506369db25",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Guides which <span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"1\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">constants</span> (latency, bandwidth, storage speeds) to use later.",
      "text": "Guides which constants (latency, bandwidth, storage speeds) to use later."
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed54801183d9cfca66a81a19",
      "type": "sub_header",
      "html": "2. Break into Components",
      "text": "2. Break into Components"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480da849be8f8a735eddd",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Once scope is clear, break the system into <span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"1\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">major building blocks</span>. Each block has its own resource requirements.",
      "text": "Once scope is clear, break the system into major building blocks. Each block has its own resource requirements."
    },
