      "id": "27524eb1ed548015917fe715fe2ece59",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480a5a852f811dae84b49",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "Do you want me to move on to <span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"1\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Step 3: Estimate Each Component</span> in full detail next,",
      "text": "Do you want me to move on to Step 3: Estimate Each Component in full detail next,"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480b486aaec2db534d277",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "or first show a <span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"1\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">worked mini-example</span> (e.g., messaging app → mapping into these components) so readers see how to break scope into pieces before estimating?",
      "text": "or first show a worked mini-example (e.g., messaging app → mapping into these components) so readers see how to break scope into pieces before estimating?"
    },
