      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "27524eb1ed54804a8902d73c12aaded6",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Bandwidth</span>: ingress (writes), egress (reads), peak vs avg",
      "text": "Bandwidth: ingress (writes), egress (reads), peak vs avg"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480d69a91e3c6cfc873ca",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "27524eb1ed54804a8902d73c12aaded6",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Compute</span>: RPS ÷ per-server capacity (CPU, RAM)",
      "text": "Compute: RPS ÷ per-server capacity (CPU, RAM)"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed54809dba2ce5b1495bc5ed",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "parent": "27524eb1ed54804a8902d73c12aaded6",
      "html": "<span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"0\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">Cache</span>: 20% hot data ≈ 80% traffic",
      "text": "Cache: 20% hot data ≈ 80% traffic"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed54805aa562c4a6504efbfd",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed54804b8329fbc8c38cfadd",
      "type": "header",
      "html": "More things to Consider",
      "text": "More things to Consider"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480d38587f24351acf90f",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Always estimate for 3–5 years growth",
      "text": "Always estimate for 3–5 years growth"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480aaa3a0ecdfab6afa2a",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Compression reduces storage and I/O needs",
      "text": "Compression reduces storage and I/O needs"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480b5a457d4cc60edbc8b",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Design for <span style=\"font-weight:600\" data-token-index=\"1\" class=\"notion-enable-hover\">peak load</span>, not average",
      "text": "Design for peak load, not average"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed54807e97eff75559aaa863",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Replication: higher cost + write load, better read &amp; availability",
      "text": "Replication: higher cost + write load, better read & availability"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480ba8596c1b64027f220",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Sharding: distributes load, but key choice matters (hotspot risk)",
      "text": "Sharding: distributes load, but key choice matters (hotspot risk)"
    },
    {
      "id": "27524eb1ed5480d8aeaed453d128b0f2",
      "type": "bulleted_list",
      "html": "Cross-DC traffic: higher latency, consider multi-leader replication",
      "text": "Cross-DC traffic: higher latency, consider multi-leader replication"
    },
    {
